---
description: Permanent repository workflow and safety guardrails.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md` before acting.

Cursor-specific requirements:

- One Cursor window must contain exactly one task worktree.
- Show the AGENTS.md preflight before the first edit.
- Stop when the folder, branch, baseline, or task differ.
- Preserve foreign WIP and stage exact paths only.
- Report changed files, tests, staging, commit, push, and PR state.
- Use the generic Checker contract in `/docs/WORKFLOW_CHECKER.md` once per completed checkpoint.
